{
    "word": "chastisement",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "fd09b30f-74c4-3936-9029-e7e9fe370c7a",
                "word": "chastisement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "05b972da-fc57-41c1-820e-295de9463c6a",
                        "entry_id": "fd09b30f-74c4-3936-9029-e7e9fe370c7a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chastisements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                        "entry_id": "fd09b30f-74c4-3936-9029-e7e9fe370c7a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of chastising; rebuke; punishment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b26656f-31fa-4604-b28b-0f74c74541c2",
                                "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                                "text": "Besides, the King hath wasted all his rods\nOn late offenders, that he now doth lack\nThe very instruments of chastisement;\nSo that his power, like to a fangless lion,\nMay offer, but not hold."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fda40b6-43bf-4446-84d3-7e11f4b7f526",
                                "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                                "text": "But he was wounded for our transgressions, he was bruised for our iniquities: the chastisement of our peace was upon him; and with his stripes we are healed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ced9c07-f9da-407c-9997-15aab41562d4",
                                "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                                "text": "All this he called “doing his duty by their parents;” and he never inflicted a chastisement without following it by the assurance, so consolatory to the smarting urchin, that “he would remember it and thank him for it the longest day he had to live.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98d7b283-8919-4018-8a43-4ca5a874e74a",
                                "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                                "text": "Into the details of the infamy at which I thus connived (for even now I can scarce grant that I committed it) I have no design of entering; I mean but to point out the warnings and the successive steps with which my chastisement approached."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f93e3b7-c5a6-436d-8e0b-2759b21bae78",
                                "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                                "text": "It seems to me that as he does not respond to this extremely conciliatory treatment it may be well to try whether a change of treatment might not produce a more satisfactory result. If praise and courtesy only result in narrow, bitter partisanship, perhaps a little well-merited chastisement may procure some geniality."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c74a7215-f9ad-4aa1-97ee-5fa01375985d",
                                "sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                                "text": "Abolition of defence of reasonable chastisement"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08d723ec-3513-4441-a154-a173f11b7f69",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd09b30f-74c4-3936-9029-e7e9fe370c7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                        "source_sense_description": "the act of chastising; rebuke; punishment",
                        "target_lang_word": "châtiment",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "châtiment",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca6a1cc1-a6ce-3c21-bb9f-832907655a98",
                                        "entry_id": "4f251bb3-9874-3375-b914-7ac0f8d2b226",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peine infligée en vue de corriger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "006f9407-09dc-486a-b3e4-5d1bbc9c284a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6a1cc1-a6ce-3c21-bb9f-832907655a98",
                                                "text": "L'attitude de la théologie chrétienne à l'égard des juifs a été fixée dans le début du IVᵉ siècle (concile de Nicée, 325) : le judaïsme ne doit pas se faire connaitre, il doit vivre, mais dans un état d'avilissement et de misère tel qu'il fasse nettement apparaître aux yeux des croyants comme des incroyants le châtiment infligé par Dieu à ceux qui n'ont pas voulu reconnaître la divinité de Jésus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96a86b8-3f9b-47ea-ae5a-ae58d1da930a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6a1cc1-a6ce-3c21-bb9f-832907655a98",
                                                "text": "Quant à moi, […], je souhaiterais que des châtiments vraiment effrayants frappassent ceux qui, médecins ou matrones, pour de l'argent, se font les instruments de tels crimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c6bc357-90bc-4c11-b51e-ee06e12dbaba",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6a1cc1-a6ce-3c21-bb9f-832907655a98",
                                                "text": "Toutes sortes de châtiments le démangeait. Mais sans doute le guettaient-ils dans les rues où il ne passait pas. Quelquefois, c'est un fait, le châtiment guette mal, sa montre se détraque, et quand enfin il s'abat, il tombe sur un colègue modèle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d460bd16-3232-4f4c-a154-4247f04c0606",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6a1cc1-a6ce-3c21-bb9f-832907655a98",
                                                "text": "Jusqu'à il y a quatre ans, les tribunaux cafouillaient. Est-ce-que la chaise électrique et la chambre à gaz sont des châtiments cruels et inhabituels ? L'attente entre la condamnation et l'exécution est-elle un châtiment cruel et inhabituel ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d725b58-e20d-4a79-bd6f-d05348206334",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd09b30f-74c4-3936-9029-e7e9fe370c7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "8db3dcf5-931c-39d8-b6de-47e92f9a9e57",
                        "source_sense_description": "the act of chastising; rebuke; punishment",
                        "target_lang_word": "Strafe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Strafe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7539442c-c869-3c74-8207-1e114a76163e",
                                        "entry_id": "bd34d6d7-d0dd-31ee-bb22-ef9ec5745f8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sanktion, wegen Fehlverhalten erhaltene Reaktion"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d62cb7-409e-4f42-8370-f0ad6bd6a6e1",
                                                "sense_id": "7539442c-c869-3c74-8207-1e114a76163e",
                                                "text": "Er muss als Strafe ins Gefängnis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c734c015-bdd0-4c6f-8a8e-8c11b82bbf7b",
                                                "sense_id": "7539442c-c869-3c74-8207-1e114a76163e",
                                                "text": "„Später hören wir, dass er zu drei Jahren Gefängnis verurteilt worden ist und die Strafe wortlos angenommen hat.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cbdbeea-6060-4185-a71e-daa839754353",
                                                "sense_id": "7539442c-c869-3c74-8207-1e114a76163e",
                                                "text": "„Viele waren vor Strafen oder Verfolgung in ihren Heimatländern geflohen, von Mördern und Kriegsverbrechern über Pleitiers bis zu Kriegsdienstverweigerern und politischen Aktivisten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d127036-476d-467f-8dcb-7d348b8b39fc",
                                                "sense_id": "7539442c-c869-3c74-8207-1e114a76163e",
                                                "text": "„Weder ist die Strafe nur pädagogisches Mittel, noch kann sie gemäßigt werden durch politische Rücksichten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c85d06d1-e146-419d-be6e-3d2e6dba9935",
                                                "sense_id": "7539442c-c869-3c74-8207-1e114a76163e",
                                                "text": "„Auch das lehre Selbstkontrolle, meinte sie schulterzuckend, und dass für Milena der Kurs dann wohl Strafe genug gewesen sei.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7132bc83-c8ac-3e9b-984f-28ba9f7943a4",
                                        "entry_id": "bd34d6d7-d0dd-31ee-bb22-ef9ec5745f8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Geldstrafe"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "im engeren Sinne"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99ab258e-cca5-44fd-9e68-8b16b1ec422a",
                                                "sense_id": "7132bc83-c8ac-3e9b-984f-28ba9f7943a4",
                                                "text": "Wenn du erwischt wirst, musst du sicher eine hohe Strafe zahlen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
